# Meeting

## Testing Advice

- Don't change too much based on the user's feedback
- You shouldn't have different software between tests
- You should try to minimise the noise you introduce to testing
- If you want to treat the 2nd user test as another pilot, then that's ok
    - Then restart the study
    - But you don't want to do that over and over again
- For now we'll keep the main branch the same and do the rest of the user testing

